---
import { eventConfig } from '../config/event.mjs';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="ah-about ah-section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="ah-section-heading">
    <h2 id="about-heading" data-public-about-title>一场聚会，两种精彩。</h2>
    <p data-public-about-text>组织者与青年创作者，在同一个现场相遇。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="ah-program-grid">
    <article class="ah-program-card" data-program="ggj">
      <div class="ah-program-number"><span>01</span><Icon name="share" /></div>
      <h3 class="ah-program-title"><span>GGJ</span> <strong>中国交流聚会</strong></h3>
      <p>交换站点经验，认识下一次一起创作的人。</p>
      <ul class="ah-program-tags" aria-label="GGJ 活动内容"><li>主题分享</li><li>组织者圆桌</li><li>新站点咨询</li></ul>
    </article>
    <article class="ah-program-card" data-program="artdico">
      <div class="ah-program-number"><span>02</span><Icon name="gamepad" /></div>
      <h3 class="ah-program-title"><span>ARTDiCO HOST</span> <strong>学生嘉年华</strong></h3>
      <p>把想法变成作品，把作品带到大家面前。</p>
      <ul class="ah-program-tags" aria-label="学生嘉年华活动内容"><li>作品分享</li><li>游戏试玩</li><li>现场反馈</li></ul>
    </article>
  </div>
  <details class="ah-highlights-detail ah-program-detail">
    <summary>现有 GGJ 负责人 / 新站点筹备，如何参与？ <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary>
    <div class="ah-highlight-list">
      <p><strong>{eventConfig.siteRegistration.existing.title}</strong>：选择 SO / RO，填写站点与组织经历。</p>
      <p><strong>{eventConfig.siteRegistration.prospective.title}</strong>：选择新站点筹备，填写城市、机构与支持需求。</p>
      <p>{eventConfig.siteRegistration.notice}</p>
    </div>
  </details>
</section>
